{"4084710": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rayman Legends Retold", "steam_appid": 4084710, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>Deluxe Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084710/extras/f76159a5a08a4d9c8903ed086078e220.avif?t=1788192199\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084710/extras_big/f76159a5a08a4d9c8903ed086078e220.avif?t=1788192199 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Deluxe Edition includes the base game, Rayman Origins: Enhanced Edition, the Retro Pack with 4 costumes for Rayman, Globox, Barbara, and Grand Minimus, and the in-game Art Gallery.</p></p><br><h1>Rayman Legends Retold Pre-Purchase Bonus</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084710/extras/f49d3c82f0227f2a5e5c3d5bd0b44bd6.avif?t=1788192199\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084710/extras_big/f49d3c82f0227f2a5e5c3d5bd0b44bd6.avif?t=1788192199 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pre-purchase any edition of Rayman Legends Retold and receive the exclusive Hoodlum Havoc Pack, containing 2 costumes for Rayman and Globox inspired by Rayman 3: Hoodlum Havoc.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Pre-purchase any edition of Rayman Legends Retold and receive the exclusive Hoodlum Havoc Pack, containing 2 costumes for Rayman and Globox inspired by Rayman 3: Hoodlum Havoc.<br><br>Includes: the base game + Rayman Origins: Enhanced Edition.<br><br>Embark on a bold reimagining of the acclaimed platformer, filled with new content and narrative twists. When a shadowy villain spreads corruption across the Glade of Dreams, journey through its charming worlds solo or in up to 4‑player couch co‑op in a fast‑paced, side‑scrolling adventure where every stumble and surprise adds to the delightful chaos.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084710/extras/bf295e1a400793bf4a3122ffc3abf2ff.avif?t=1788192199\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084710/extras_big/bf295e1a400793bf4a3122ffc3abf2ff.webp?t=1788192199 width=1560 height=81 /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084710/extras/ed47aff6d1479da66d2d3b72f55a55df.poster.avif?t=1788192199\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084710/extras/ed47aff6d1479da66d2d3b72f55a55df.webm?t=1788192199\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084710/extras/ed47aff6d1479da66d2d3b72f55a55df.mp4?t=1788192199\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Leap, glide, and punch your way through worlds bursting with charm and delightful surprises. Craving a change of pace? Dive into unforgettable musical stages, where every move must sync with the beat for a rhythm‑powered thrill.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084710/extras/2641c34edd7ee1ecd4bdb74587b2b717.avif?t=1788192199\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084710/extras_big/2641c34edd7ee1ecd4bdb74587b2b717.webp?t=1788192199 width=1560 height=81 /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084710/extras/54b17056447acab67677290b2ffd18ed.poster.avif?t=1788192199\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084710/extras/54b17056447acab67677290b2ffd18ed.webm?t=1788192199\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084710/extras/54b17056447acab67677290b2ffd18ed.mp4?t=1788192199\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Immerse yourself in a world brimming with life, reimagined with stunning visuals. A rich selection of iconic levels returns alongside a mysterious sixth realm and 4 new musical stages. Saddle up for epic dragon rides and test your skills in the Cave of Trials.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084710/extras/2003836b799c294341fc39f25214dd9c.avif?t=1788192199\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084710/extras_big/2003836b799c294341fc39f25214dd9c.webp?t=1788192199 width=1560 height=81 /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084710/extras/994dcc8b35d45968fa92cd0419a69a27.poster.avif?t=1788192199\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084710/extras/994dcc8b35d45968fa92cd0419a69a27.webm?t=1788192199\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084710/extras/994dcc8b35d45968fa92cd0419a69a27.mp4?t=1788192199\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Join Rayman and his friends on their most ambitious adventure yet, facing a new foe stirring trouble from the underworld. Voiced cinematics and an expanded soundtrack by Christophe Héral and Grant Kirkhope bring the journey to life, blending original themes with new compositions.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://sh